        <mxCell id="footer_box" value="&lt;b&gt;Catatan Balance &amp;amp; Opsi A:&lt;/b&gt; Aliran Entitas ↔ Proses balance 100% dengan Level 0 (tanpa D17 / Kurir Zendo). Duplikasi (*) hanya pada D1*, D2*, D3*, D5*, D6*, D7*, D16* (maks. 2×).&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Legenda:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color:#0284c7&quot;&gt;Biru = Pelanggan (1.0–4.0)&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;color:#6d28d9&quot;&gt;Ungu = Admin (5.0–10.0)&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;color:#059669&quot;&gt;Hijau = Kasir (11.0–12.0)&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d4ed8&quot;&gt;Silinder = Data Store (garis ganda + * = duplikat)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="8" y="895" width="1515" height="47" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
